+special constrained cut objects used here: a weighted separator is found by
+at most k Ford-Fulkerson rounds in O(k(n+m)).  Therefore this generator makes
+no Track-A claim.  Its successful reference algorithm computes the unique
+sparse terminal cut with unit-capacity augmenting paths and fits the affine
+polynomial by exact GF(2) elimination.
