+        "Track B: Section 4, Lemma 5 reduces the constrained cut search to at "
+        "most k Ford-Fulkerson rounds in O(k(n+m)), followed here by GF(2) "
+        "elimination to recover the displayed polynomial; final measured cost "
+        "is filled from selftest at the shipping preset, while the compact "
+        "kernel route uses at most 300 exact bit operations."
