+        "on this generated regime, unit-capacity Ford-Fulkerson plus GF(2) "
+        "elimination runs in O(k(n+m)+n*d^2) and at shipping n=60 measured a "
+        "median 21,417 counted bit operations and 0.000501 seconds over eight "
