-Generation is inverse: it samples a balanced affine polynomial first, makes
-two circulant pieces inside its fibres, joins them by a `k`-edge matching, and
-removes an internal matching so every vertex keeps the same degree. The planted
-crossing matching has rank exactly `k`, so the certificate is known before the
