The planted response is `<answer>1011011|1</answer>`. Internally this is
`[1,0,1,1,0,1,1,1]`, and `verify` returns `(True, "ok")`. Replacing the final
bit by `2` returns `(False, "coefficient outside GF(2)")`. The demo has only
64 oriented affine candidates and one valid answer; it is intentionally small
enough to check on paper, although solving it still takes patient XOR work.

