-Theorem 1 is the STEP-0 warning: general Bipartite Contraction has randomized
-running time `2^{O(k^2)}nm` and deterministic running time
-`2^{O(k^2)}n^{O(1)}`. Lemma 7's constrained Rank-Cut routine uses weighted
-minimum cut in `O(k(n+m))`. On this generated distribution, the reference
-algorithm runs unit-capacity Ford–Fulkerson and then fits the affine separator
-by exact Gaussian elimination over `F_2`. At the shipping preset it solved
