**Release status:** G1–G8 pass. G9 and the required oracle hardening are
unscored because every script-owned OpenRouter call returned HTTP 403, `Key
limit exceeded (total limit)`. This is an external release blocker, not a
hardness result; the family must not be submitted until the bare, hinted, and
