   123	graphic-rank constraint.  Those definitions rule out the prior triage label
   124	"reconfiguration": the witness is an unordered edge set, not a sequence.
   125	
   126	Theorems 11 and 12 are the STEP-0 algorithm warning for Rank-Cut: randomized
   127	2^{O(k^2)} n m and deterministic 2^{O(k^2)} n^{O(1)} algorithms exist.
   128	Theorem 1 transfers these bounds to Bipartite Contraction.  Section 4, Lemma 7
   129	also exhibits the relevant
   130	easy mechanism on Constrained Rank-Cut: a weighted separator is found by at
   131	most k Ford-Fulkerson rounds in O(k(n+m)).  Our instances are ordinary
   132	Rank-Cut, not that constrained input, but their sparse matching cut admits the
   133	same unit-capacity mechanism.  Therefore this generator makes no Track-A
